    "\n",
    "## Problem 2\n",
    "2a) Address the sensitivity to outliers for regression models in general. About half a\n",
    "page to a page in length, no need for more!\n",
    "2b) Then, use a simulated instance to discuss/illustrate how the presence of outliers\n",
    "can change the estimated parameters for a regression model. Make a special\n",
    "effort to describe clearly how your simulation project was put together."
   ]
